    "holidayIn: a festival that is a public holiday in that region. workdayIn: a central holiday that is a working day in that region (shown as a festival there). except: hidden in that region because the region's own row replaces it (a different date).",
    "bank: banks close in Kerala that day. Only reported for region IN-KL.",
    "recurring: MM-DD rows added every year (business dates for an Indian businessman)."
